# Secrets. The connection string carries a database password.
.env
*.user

# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
publish/
*.binlog

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo

# The repository root .gitignore has `[Ll]ogs/` - a stock Visual Studio rule
# meant for log OUTPUT directories. It also matched two source folders here and
# silently dropped them from every commit, so the project built on a developer's
# machine and failed inside the container with "the namespace Logs does not
# exist". Nothing warned, because git never reports what it declined to add.
#
# Renaming is not an option for the view folder: ASP.NET MVC resolves
# LogsController's views from Views/Logs/ by convention. So the exclusion is
# lifted, scoped to the source tree - real log output would never live under
# src/.
!src/**/Logs/
!src/**/Logs/**
